.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-s3-versions-delete - Permanently delete a version


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro s3 versions delete   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Permanently delete a version

.PP
Permanently deletes one version or delete marker (cannot be undone). Versions under GOVERNANCE / COMPLIANCE retention or legal hold are refused with the end date. Needs \fBconfirm=true\fR\&.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/storage/{id}/buckets/{bucket}/versions (operationId deleteStorageVersion, scope services_write)


